      "text": "2. Alcohol"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 31,
      "heading_id": "heading_00005",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "3. Excessive caffeine"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 34,
      "heading_id": "heading_00006",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "4. Some herbal supplements and teas"
    },
    {
      "block_index": 37,
      "heading_id": "heading_00007",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Can your baby react to the foods you eat while breastfeeding?"
